<?php
/* TEMPORARY (owner, 14 Nov 2026): Art Map addresses in Arabic. Makes a full backup, adds the column art_places.address_ar
   (art_places_address_ar.sql, add-only) and fills it for the places whose English address is unchanged.
   Locked by a secret key, runs once. Removed straight after. */
if (!hash_equals('8c08010e4a813603ca8c95b2e0653ee536e5b0f838d9c8487af4b963c9e89cf1', hash('sha256', (string) ($_GET['k'] ?? '')))) { http_response_code(404); exit; }
require_once __DIR__ . '/config.php';
require_once __DIR__ . '/platform_lib.php';
header('Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8'); header('Cache-Control: no-store'); header('X-Robots-Tag: noindex');
@set_time_limit(300);
$db = getDB();
$plan = json_decode(base64_decode(''), true);
$has = (bool) $db->query("SHOW COLUMNS FROM art_places LIKE 'address_ar'")->fetch();
if (($_GET['a'] ?? '') !== 'run') { echo 'column now: ', $has ? 'yes' : 'no', "\n", 'plan: ', count($plan), "\n"; exit; }
if (is_file(__DIR__ . '/.logs/zz-addr-done')) { echo "already run\n"; exit; }
$dbName = (string) $db->query('SELECT DATABASE()')->fetchColumn();
/* 1. full backup */
$dir = __DIR__ . '/.backups';
if (!is_dir($dir)) { @mkdir($dir, 0700, true); }
if (!is_file($dir . '/.htaccess')) { @file_put_contents($dir . '/.htaccess', "Require all denied\n"); }
$file = $dir . '/db-' . preg_replace('/[^a-z0-9_]/i', '', $dbName) . '-' . gmdate('Ymd-His') . '.sql.gz';
$gz = gzopen($file, 'wb6');
if (!$gz) { echo "backup FAILED: cannot write\n"; exit; }
gzwrite($gz, "-- Oweili full backup " . gmdate('c') . "\nSET NAMES utf8mb4;\nSET FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS=0;\n");
$tables = $db->query('SHOW FULL TABLES WHERE Table_type = "BASE TABLE"')->fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_COLUMN);
$rows = 0;
foreach ($tables as $t) {
    $t = str_replace('`', '', (string) $t);
    $c = $db->query("SHOW CREATE TABLE `$t`")->fetch(PDO::FETCH_NUM);
    gzwrite($gz, "\nDROP TABLE IF EXISTS `$t`;\n" . $c[1] . ";\n");
    $st = $db->query("SELECT * FROM `$t`");
    while ($r = $st->fetch(PDO::FETCH_NUM)) {
        $vals = array_map(fn($v) => $v === null ? 'NULL' : $db->quote((string) $v), $r);
        gzwrite($gz, "INSERT INTO `$t` VALUES (" . implode(',', $vals) . ");\n");
        $rows++;
    }
}
gzwrite($gz, "\nSET FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS=1;\n");
gzclose($gz);
$size = (int) filesize($file);
if ($size < 500) { echo "backup FAILED (too small)\n"; exit; }
echo "backup ok: .backups/" . basename($file) . " (" . count($tables) . " tables, $rows rows, $size bytes)\n";

$db->exec("ALTER TABLE `art_places` ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS `address_ar` VARCHAR(300) NOT NULL DEFAULT '' AFTER `address`");
echo "column added\n";
$st = $db->prepare('UPDATE art_places SET address_ar = :ar WHERE id = :id AND address = :en');
$n = 0; $skip = [];
foreach ($plan as $p) { $st->execute([':ar' => $p['ar'], ':id' => (int) $p['id'], ':en' => $p['en']]); if ($st->rowCount()) $n++; else $skip[] = $p['id']; }
echo "filled: $n of ", count($plan), $skip ? ' (not changed: ' . implode(', ', $skip) . ')' : '', "\n";
if (function_exists('owSchemaForget')) owSchemaForget();
@file_put_contents(__DIR__ . '/.logs/zz-addr-done', gmdate('c'));
echo 'published with an Arabic address: ', $db->query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM art_places WHERE status = 'published' AND address <> '' AND address_ar <> ''")->fetchColumn(),
     ' of ', $db->query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM art_places WHERE status = 'published' AND address <> ''")->fetchColumn(), "\n";
